    "updated_at": "2026-09-04T22:13:49Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure whether I agree with the conclusions about the constituent licenses here. That is, if the FSF says \"composite license Foo AND Bar is a free software license\", I'm not sure it follows that Foo and Bar are (in the opinion of the FSF) free software licenses on their own. I understand of course why one might logically conclude this might be the case. ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
