    "updated_at": "2026-09-10T14:16:49Z",
    "body": "> Does the [#3075](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/pull/3075) resolve this issue?\n\nNo. The issue here is whether a license is \"FSF Free/Libre\" (that is, whether FSF considers the license to be a free software license). #3075 has to do with OSI approval. ",
